   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "___ is a ___ year-old right-handed man with history of HTN\nand lymphoma s/p chemo/radiation who presents with a 2 day\nhistory of fluctuating symptoms of intermittent confusion and\nunsteady gait who was referred to the ED for an outpatient MRI\nthat showed a new stroke.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=385-653",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Per the patient and his daughter who is at the bedside and\nconfirms the history, Mr. ___ symptoms began this last ___ when he was preparing the home for visitors coming from ___.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=655-833",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was at home alone in the afternoon, helping\nto move a car from his driveway when he backed into a retaining\nwall at home.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=835-968",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He is normally a good driver and this was unusual\nfor him.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=970-1028",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Earlier in the afternoon he recalls driving down the\nblock and swerved wildly when trying to turn off a light in the\ncar.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=1030-1151",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Neighbors notified the police that someone was recklessly\ndriving down the block.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=1153-1234",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "His family was not with him initially\nwhen these symptoms began and when they returned home they found\nthe patient seemingly confused in the car after he hit the wall.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=1236-1403",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He was easily reoriented and apparently was at his usual \nbaseline\nexcept he was more withdrawn than usual that evening.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=1406-1526",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The\npatient denies headache, vision change, speech problems, \nweakness\nor sensory loss.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=1528-1615",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He is in denial about his initial confusion,\nbut family confirms he did not seem himself.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=1617-1706",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was \"quieter than usual\" throughout the day",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=1710-1765",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "___,\nand on ___ while with family at dinner at the ___ he appeared to be   stumbling to the left.",
