   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He presents to the ED\nacutely tonight after PCP ___ (Dr. ___ in ___)\nearlier today who recommended urgent MRI and carotid ultrasound.",
