   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Scattered foci of high signal intensity \ndetected on FLAIR and T2 weighted images, distributed in the \nsubcortical and periventricular white matter, are nonspecific \nand may reflect changes due to small vessel disease.There is no \nevidence of abnormal enhancement.",
