   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# Multifocal R MCA Strokes",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=6148-6174",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Patient presented to the ED for further evaluation and \nmanagement.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=6238-6305",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The pattern of his ischemia was very consistent for \na embolic source- vascular particularly given its single \ndistribution.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=6307-6431",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Subsequent MRA demonstrated signficant \nintracranial vessel stenosis, particularly in the R MCA and \nvertebral arteries and therefore intracranial atherosclerosis \nwith artery-to-artery embolism was thought to be the most likely \nmechanism for his infarcts.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=6433-6690",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He was started on aspirin 81mg \ndaily and atorvastatin 40mg dailys.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16444864-DS-19:chars=6692-6759",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
